\"><pre>XGBClassifier(base_score=None, booster=None, callbacks=None,\n              colsample_bylevel=None, colsample_bynode=None,\n              colsample_bytree=0.6, device=&#x27;cuda&#x27;, early_stopping_rounds=None,\n              enable_categorical=False, eval_metric=&#x27;logloss&#x27;,\n              feature_types=None, gamma=0.3, grow_policy=None,\n              importance_type=None, interaction_constraints=None,\n              learning_rate=0.2, max_bin=None, max_cat_threshold=None,\n              max_cat_to_onehot=None, max_delta_step=None, max_depth=6,\n              max_leaves=None, min_child_weight=3, missing=nan,\n              monotone_constraints=None, multi_strategy=None, n_estimators=500,\n              n_jobs=None, num_parallel_tree=None, random_state=None, ...)</pre></div></div></div></div></div>"},"metadata":{}}],"execution_count":22},{"id":"a9b49894-bb4e-4e99-b154-71be512f83a4","cell_type":"code","source":"wrapped_model = WrappedModel(model)\ncalibrated_model = CalibratedClassifierCV(estimator=wrapped_model, cv='prefit')\ncalibrated_model.fit(X_train_fi, y_train)\n\ny_pred = calibrated_model.predict(X_test_fi)\ny_pred_prob = calibrated_model.predict_proba(X_test_fi)\n\n# Accuracy\nprint(f'Accuracy: {metrics.accuracy_score(y_test, y_pred):.4f}')\n\n# Precision, Recall, F1\nprint(f'Precision: {metrics.precision_score(y_test, y_pred, average=\"binary\"):.4f}')\nprint(f'Recall: {metrics.recall_score(y_test, y_pred, average=\"binary\"):.4f}')\nprint(f'F1 Score (macro): {metrics.f1_score(y_test, y_pred, average=\"macro\"):.4f}')\nprint(f'F1 Score (weighted): {metrics.f1_score(y_test, y_pred, average=\"weighted\"):.4f}')\n\n# Log loss\nprint(f'Log Loss: {metrics.log_loss(y_test, y_pred_prob):.4f}')\n\n# Classification report\nprint(\"\\nClassification Report:\")\nprint(metrics.classification_report(y_test, y_pred, digits=4))","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2025-05-18T03:19:38.025252Z","iopub.execute_input":"2025-05-18T03:19:38.025556Z","iopub.status.idle":"2025-05-18T03:20:59.567526Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2025-05-18T03:19:38.025537Z","shell.execute_reply":"2025-05-18T03:20:59.566392Z"},"trusted":true},"outputs":[{"name":"stderr","text":"/usr/local/lib/python3.11/dist-packages/xgboost/core.py:160: UserWarning: [03:19:38] WARNING: /workspace/src/common/error_msg.cc:58: Falling back to prediction using DMatrix due to mismatched devices. This might lead to higher memory usage and slower performance. XGBoost is running on: cuda:0, while the input data is on: cpu.\nPotential solutions:\n- Use a data structure that matches the device ordinal in the booster.\n- Set the device for booster before call to inplace_predict.\n\nThis warning will only be shown once.\n\n  warnings.warn(smsg, UserWarning)\n","output_type":"stream"},{"name":"stdout","text":"Accuracy: 0.6779\nPrecision: 0.6709\nRecall: 0.6985\nF1 Score (macro): 0.6778\nF1 Score (weighted): 0.6778\nLog Loss: 0.6903\n\nClassification Report:\n              precision    recall  f1-score   support\n\n           0     0.6855    0.6573    0.6711   1373014\n           1     0.6709    0.6985    0.6844   1373013\n\n    accuracy                         0.6779   2746027\n   macro avg     0.6782    0.6779    0.6778   2746027\nweighted avg     0.6782    0.6779    0.6778   2746027\n\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":23},{"id":"307422eb","cell_type":"markdown","source":"# 12. Principal Component Analysis","metadata":{}},{"id":"4da41f40","cell_type":"markdown","source":"PCA là phương pháp giảm chiều dữ liệu tuyến tính bằng cách tìm các **trục chính** (principal components) – là các trục có phương sai dữ liệu lớn nhất.\n\n---\n\n## 12.1. **Giả sử**:\n\n* Dữ liệu gốc: $X \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n \\times d}$, với:\n\n  * $n$: số mẫu\n  * $d$: số chiều gốc\n\n---\n\n## 12.2. **Chuẩn hóa dữ liệu**:\n\nTrung bình hóa (zero-mean) từng chiều:\n\n$$\n\\tilde{X} = X - \\bar{X}\n$$\n\nvới $\\bar{X}$ là vector trung bình theo từng cột.\n\n---\n\n## 12.3. **Ma trận hiệp phương sai** (Covariance matrix):\n\n$$\nC = \\frac{1}{n - 1} \\tilde{X}^T \\tilde{X} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d \\times d}\n$$\n\n---\n\n## 12.4. **Tính các vector riêng và trị riêng**:\n\n$$\nC \\mathbf{v}_i = \\lambda_i \\mathbf{v}_i\n$$\n\n* $\\lambda_i$: trị riêng (eigenvalue)\n* $\\mathbf{v}_i$: vector riêng (eigenvector) – chính là **trục chính** thứ $i$\n* Chọn $k$ vector riêng tương ứng với $k$ trị riêng lớn nhất.\n\n---\n\n## 12.5. **Chiếu dữ liệu lên không gian mới**:\n\nNếu chọn $k$ trục chính:\n\n* Ma trận trục chính: $W \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d \\times k}$\n* Dữ liệu sau PCA:\n\n$$\nZ = \\tilde{X} W \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n \\times k}\n$$\n\n---\n\n##  Tóm tắt:\n\n| Bước             | Công thức chính                           |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 1. Chuẩn hóa     | $\\tilde{X} = X - \\bar{X}$                 |\n| 2. Covariance    | $C = \\frac{1}{n-1} \\tilde{X}^T \\tilde{X}$ |\n| 3. Eigen         | $C v = \\lambda v$                         |\n| 4. Chiếu dữ liệu | $Z = \\tilde{X} W$                         |\n\n---\n\nVới những đặc trưng không quan trọng, chúng ta sẽ dùng `PCA` để nén chúng lại để giảm chiều dữ liệu.","metadata":{}},{"id":"e5a898b1-b0fb-435f-8f86-db6d9b3f8c8e","cell_type":"code","source":"X_train_pca = X_train[non_important_feature]\nX_test_pca = X_test[non_important_feature]","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2025-05-18T03:42:37.616541Z","iopub.execute_input":"2025-05-18T03:42:37.617188Z","iopub.status.idle":"2025-05-18T03:42:38.507946Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2025-05-18T03:42:37.617161Z","shell.execute_reply":"2025-05-18T03:42:38.507331Z"},"trusted":true},"outputs":[],"execution_count":8},{"id":"a37b962d-132a-475e-a290-a634dd478ec0","cell_type":"code","source":"%%time\nscores = []\ntimes = []\nn = len(X_train_pca.columns)\n\nfor i in tqdm(range(1, n + 1)):\n    \n    pca = PCA(copy=True, iterated_power=100, n_components=i, verbose=1)\n    X_train_pca_tf = pca.fit_transform(X_train_pca)\n    X_test_pca_tf = pca.transform(X_test_pca)\n\n    start = time.time()\n    model = XGBClassifier(\n        objective='binary:logistic',\n        tree_method='hist',\n        device='cuda',\n        use_label_encoder=False,\n        eval_metric='logloss',\n        subsample=1.0,\n        reg_lambda=2.5,\n        reg_alpha=10,\n        n_estimators=500,\n        min_child_weight=3,\n        max_depth=6,\n        learning_rate=0.2,\n        colsample_bytree=0.6,\n        gamma=0.3\n    )\n    model.fit(X_train_pca_tf, y_train)\n    end = time.time()\n    \n    y_pred = model.predict(X_test_pca_tf)\n    y_pred_prob = model.predict_proba(X_test_pca_tf)\n    \n    scores.append(metrics.log_loss(y_test, y_pred_prob))\n    times.append(end - start)","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2025-05-11T03:25:28.936697Z","iopub.status.busy":"2025-05-11T03:25:28.936416Z","iopub.status.idle":"2025-05-11T04:43:27.095761Z","shell.execute_reply":"2025-05-11T04:43:27.094971Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2025-05-11T03:25:28.936657Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stderr","output_type":"stream","text":["100%|██████████| 52/52 [1:17:58<00:00, 89.96s/it] "]},{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["CPU times: user 2h 8min 20s, sys: 4min 29s, total: 2h 12min 50s\n","Wall time: 1h 17min 58s\n"]},{"name":"stderr","output_type":"stream","text":["\n"]}],"execution_count":34},{"id":"79714922-d70f-4583-9ac3-b21e9b902f35","cell_type":"code","source":"scores_norm = (np.asarray(scores) - np.min(scores)) / (np.max(scores) - np.min(scores))\ntimes_norm = (np.asarray(times) - np.min(times)) / (np.max(times) - np.min(times))\n\nplt.figure(figsize=(15, 6))\nplt.plot(scores_norm, label='Scores (Normalized)', color='deeppink')\nplt.plot(times_norm, label='Time (Normalized)', color='deepskyblue')\n\nplt.xlabel(\"N - Features\")\nplt.ylabel(\"Normalized Value\")\nplt.legend()\nplt.grid(True)\nplt.show()","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2025-05-11T04:44:28.311096Z","iopub.status.busy":"2025-05-11T04:44:28.310347Z","iopub.status.idle":"2025-05-11T04:44:28.516493Z","shell.execute_reply":"2025-05-11T04:44:28.515731Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2025-05-11T04:44:28.311069Z"}},"outputs":[{"data":{"image/png":"","text/plain":["<Figure size 1500x600 with 1 Axes>"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"}],"execution_count":35},{"id":"d9207524","cell_type":"markdown","source":"Chúng ta thấy được rằng, khi tăng features lên thì thời gian cũng tăng lên tuyến tính. Và khi số lượng features nằm ở 25 thì `log loss` bắt đầu hội tụ. Vậy chúng ta sẽ nén những features còn lại thành 25 features, kết hợp với những features được chọn ra để làm `final features`.","metadata":{}},{"id":"4676943f-2a39-4bd2-9ee5-81989aa9a063","cell_type":"code","source":"pca = PCA(copy=True, iterated_power=100, n_components=25, verbose=1)\nX_train_pca_tf = pca.fit_transform(X_train_pca)\nX_test_pca_tf = pca.transform(X_test_pca)","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2025-05-18T03:42:46.773963Z","iopub.execute_input":"2025-05-18T03:42:46.774903Z","iopub.status.idle":"2025-05-18T03:42:55.372444Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2025-05-18T03:42:46.774861Z","shell.execute_reply":"2025-05-18T03:42:55.371561Z"},"trusted":true},"outputs":[],"execution_count":9},{"id":"feebd3e2-b2d1-4912-b47e-a6254c298640","cell_type":"code","source":"X_train_fn = np.concatenate([X_train_fi, X_train_pca_tf], axis=1)\nX_test_fn = np.concatenate([X_test_fi, X_test_pca_tf], axis=1)","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2025-05-18T03:56:19.180066Z","iopub.execute_input":"2025-05-18T03:56:19.180374Z","iopub.status.idle":"2025-05-18T03:56:59.160850Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2025-05-18T03:56:19.180352Z","shell.execute_reply":"2025-05-18T03:56:59.159943Z"},"trusted":true},"outputs":[],"execution_count":23},{"id":"150032c5","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 12.6.1. Logistic Regression","metadata":{}},{"id":"d9ace7fa-9ce4-4906-8924-29394418fffa","cell_type":"code","source":"model = LogisticRegression(\n            solver='qn',\n            penalty='l2',\n            C=2.667777777777778,\n            class_weight='balanced',\n            fit_intercept=True,\n            max_iter=50000\n)\nmodel.fit(X_train_fn, y_train)\n\ny_pred = model.predict(X_test_fn)\ny_pred_prob = model.predict_proba(X_test_fn)\n\n# Accuracy\nprint(f'Accuracy: {metrics.accuracy_score(y_test, y_pred):.4f}')\n\n# Precision, Recall, F1\nprint(f'Precision: {metrics.precision_score(y_test, y_pred, average=\"binary\"):.4f}')\nprint(f'Recall: {metrics.recall_score(y_test, y_pred, average=\"binary\"):.4f}')\nprint(f'F1 Score (macro): {metrics.f1_score(y_test, y_pred, average=\"macro\"):.4f}')\nprint(f'F1 Score (weighted): {metrics.f1_score(y_test, y_pred, average=\"weighted\"):.4f}')\n\n# Log loss\nprint(f'Log Loss: {metrics.log_loss(y_test, y_pred_prob):.4f}')\n\n# Classification report\nprint(\"\\nClassification Report:\")\nprint(metrics.classification_report(y_test, y_pred, digits=4))","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2025-05-18T03:26:46.639194Z","iopub.execute_input":"2025-05-18T03:26:46.639531Z","iopub.status.idle":"2025-05-18T03:26:54.523259Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2025-05-18T03:26:46.639499Z","shell.execute_reply":"2025-05-18T03:26:54.522281Z"},"trusted":true},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Accuracy: 0.6805\nPrecision: 0.6675\nRecall: 0.7192\nF1 Score (macro): 0.6800\nF1 Score (weighted): 0.6800\nLog Loss: 0.7120\n\nClassification Report:\n              precision    recall  f1-score   support\n\n           0     0.6956    0.6418    0.6676   1373014\n           1     0.6675    0.7192    0.6924   1373013\n\n    accuracy                         0.6805   2746027\n   macro avg     0.6816    0.6805    0.6800   2746027\nweighted avg     0.6816    0.6805    0.6800   2746027\n\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":32},{"id":"523eacb6","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 12.6.2. Random Forest Classifier","metadata":{}},{"id":"0e